      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat has a 10 megabyte download limit for Quest avatars. So while texture sizes aren't part of the rating system, can only fit so much material into an avi.  Multiple people joining causing a crash should be fixed, not patched around.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
