  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-12-16T00:50:21.927Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I recently found that I crash when several users with a really high texture downloads enter an instance at once.  I know you can limit avatar downloads, but I'm not sure that texture file sizes are included.  I know that they are not included in the rating system, which is how \"good\" avatars can still become crashers (allegedly).  Hopefully there will be limits on all download types, to help people with unoptimized PCs or Quest.",
